<title>USA: A.O. Smith to buy back $80 mln of its stock.</title>
<headline>A.O. Smith to buy back $80 mln of its stock.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.O. Smith Corp said Tuesday its board authorized the repurchase of $80 million of the company's shares.</p>
<p>The repurchase was in addition to an authorization to buy back three million shares granted in January, the company said.  </p>
<p>The additional repurchase authorization covers both A.O. Smith's common stock traded on the New York Stock Exchange and its Class A common stock traded on the American Stock Exchange, it said. As of June 6, there were about 18.4 million common shares and Class A shares outstanding.</p>
<p>	    -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
